                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A model with this Wargear gains a 6+ Invulnerable save against Shooting attacks. In Addition, once per game, at the start of your movement phase, you can select one Genestealer Cult Biker unit within 6” of this model; that Unit may move an additional 6” this Phase.</characteristic>
